---
description: Application layer — use cases and ports only
globs: libs/core/application/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# core/application

- Define **ports** as abstract classes (`UserRepository`, `ClockPort`, …).
- Implement **use cases** that orchestrate ports + domain; return Promises.
- Depend only on `@senbilan/core/domain` and `@senbilan/shared/util`.
- **Never** import infra, features, entities, design-system, Angular, RxJS, state libs.
- Accept optional `AbortSignal` on read ports for cancellation.
- Validation of use-case input may live next to the use case (`*.validation.ts`).
- Export ports + use cases from `src/index.ts`.
- Tests: fake in-memory ports; no HTTP, no TestBed.
